// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CouncilmanChanged 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3573516505" "The aide's story"
// DetailString :
"P1505440636" "The aide you rescued told you:<br><br>'After the Councilman's wife died, he became interested in the Circle of Thorns. Really interested. I think he thought that he could have saved her, if he only knew some magic. He started attending Circle meetings, performing small rites and spells. And after a while, he was like a totally different person. He stopped drafting pro-hero legislation and started drafting just the opposite. He became frustrated with anyone on the council who supported heroes; I think that's why he gathered them here today. He would have killed us all if you hadn't stopped him!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P421791815" "I just got an urgent call from the city council. They were meeting at Councilman Hicks' office to discuss some new legislation, when suddenly they were attacked. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to save the city council from the Circle of Thorns.</A> I can't imagine the damage this city would suffer if all those fine people were lost! You may have as few as 90 minutes to save them!"
// AcceptString :
"P2744364081" "Save the city council from the Circle of Thorns"
// SendOffString :
"P851167861" "A loss like this would demoralize the entire city. You've got to get to those people, quick!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3388897544" "Save city council from Circle"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2861486631" "The city council is still in the grip of the Circle of Thorns. You may not have much time left!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4218088813" "The somber chanting of the Circle is not in the least disturbed by the sound of broken sobs."

