"P2603223728" "You defeated the Circle of Thorns."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3176068208" "You failed to defeat the Circle of Thorns."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2554592653" "Well, I just broke the news to Councilman Hicks' daughter. She admitted that he's been acting strange for the last couple of months: distant, moody, not himself. I think that Councilman Hicks hasn't been himself for quite some time; his body has been inhabited by one of those Circle of Thorns ghosts! I wonder how many other city officials may be mystics in disguise? We may have to watch each other carefully from now on."
// RandomFameString :
"P297921968" "Did you hear {HeroName} had to arrest Councilman Hicks? Hard to believe, I know."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P560023412" "The council members managed to get out all right, except for one: Councilman Hicks. Apparently, he was the person behind this whole debacle. His aide told me that Hicks has been interested in the Circle of Thorns for some time. I guess he picked today to declare his new allegiance."
// RandomFameString :
"P394517312" "The heroes can't even protect the city council! What's to become of an average joe like me?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_CoT_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Pendant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3339328242" "Pendant"
// DetailString :
"P1746104701" "This ancient brass pendant has been badly tarnished, its intricate designs worn almost smooth by the passage of time. When you hold it close to your body, you are aware of a slight quickening of your heartbeat, as if you sensed danger lurking from the floor beneath your feet. According to the exhibit tag, this pendant was used in the summoning of demons."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Tablet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P313541677" "Diary of Tyoss"
// DetailString :
"P675908173" "The exhibit tag calls this clay tablet, 'The Diary of Tyoss.' A roughly translated excerpt reads:<br><br>'We have behaved as animals do, brutally, savagely, without mercy. I have wept for those who die by our crimes, but have not stayed my hand. I wonder: in saving our lives, have we destroyed everything we once were?'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2479175069" "The Paragon City Museum just got a shipment of objects for next month's featured exhibit on Ancient American Cultures. I've had a chance to look at some of the items, and I think that some of them are far more ancient that anyone suspects. I think that some of those artifacts are actually Oranbegan, and I'm pretty sure the Circle of Thorns will want to get their hands on them. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to protect the Oranbegan artifacts from the Circle of Thorns.</A> We don't know what all of them are for, but I don't want to find out the hard way. The Circle will try to move quickly, they might be done in as little as 90 minutes."
// AcceptString :
"P1336778495" "Protect the Oranbegan artifacts from the Circle of Thorns"
// SendOffString :
"P2782056395" "The artifacts are being stored in a warehouse nearby. Please get over there quickly."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2618752196" "Protect artifacts from Circle"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2604004831" "I need you to protect the artifacts in that warehouse. The Circle could be there as we speak!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3141472367" "The smell of rose oil and burning fennel seeds tells you the Circle has already arrived."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2916721253" "As soon as Tyoss finds his pendant, we can proceed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P70252942" "Excellent."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1239525013" "You will never lay your hands upon our treasures!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - CEREMONY_INCANTING_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CEREMONY_INCANTING_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1168649804" "Let what was lost be found!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - CEREMONY_INCANTING_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CEREMONY_INCANTING_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3862121066" "You would take what is rightfully ours!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1108567321" "Tyoss"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2439196150" "I want that pendant!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2761853219" "You think you can steal from me?"

