"P3520328332" "You found nothing of interest."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - TabletCrate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1842508413" "You found an ancient tablet."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3209014151" "You defeated the Circle of Thorns and found some interesting artifacts."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1939856100" "You failed to prevent the Circle of Thorns from making off with some artifacts."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P12133703" "This pendant you found will have to go to MAGI; it's far too dangerous for public display. The tablet, on the other hand, seems to have no mystical properties whatsoever. But it certainly is interesting. Based on the brutality of the Circle's sacrifices, I had always assumed Oranbega was a cruel and savage society. It seems I may have been wrong. Something must have must have hardened the Circle's hearts against humanity. I only wish I knew what that was."
// RandomFameString :
"P523032200" "Let's go see that museum exhibit {HeroName} saved!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2274587958" "Well, the Circle got away with a few of the artifacts. I'm afraid the museum curator couldn't tell me exactly what new dangers we may have to face; we'll just have to keep a sharp eye on those mystics from now on."
// RandomFameString :
"P899890532" "Did you see that exhibit at the museum? I heard the Circle of Thorns made off with the best artifacts!"

