// IntroString :
"P2572964871" "<A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to rescue some policemen from the Circle of Thorns!</A> Four officers were kidnapped from Daniel's Donut Shack just a few minutes ago. It seems as though they were targeted; none of the other customers were harmed. <br>I know that the Circle is planning something big with those policemen. You probably won't have more than 60 minutes to rescue all four of them and defeat the leaders of the ritual."
// AcceptString :
"P2251434673" "Rescue the policemen from the Circle of Thorns within 1 hour"
// SendOffString :
"P1089897867" "No one knows better than you that this city is tough on crime fighters. We owe those officers all the help we can give them. Just remember that you'll only have an hour at most to save them."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1985138415" "Stop cult leader & his guards"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3457863834" "Our boys in blue are still missing. Find them, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1694859009" "You hear voices lifted in a rhythmic chant. You'll have to move fast to save those officers from a sacrificial blade."

