"P2188832046" "The souls of the guardians shall protect our borders."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - CEREMONY_INCANTING_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CEREMONY_INCANTING_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4196691885" "Another sacrifice!"

