"P3388524999" "Thanks for the save, {Rescuer}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2328544638" "You defeated the Circle and rescued the policemen."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P405444268" "You failed to rescue the policemen in time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4249425455" "There may be a commendation in this for you, {HeroName}. I can't remember when I've seen the chief of police so happy. It seems the Circle was trying to craft some sort of protection spell for their city. Ordinarily I'd be happy if they wanted to seal themselves off from us, but not if it means the lives of Paragon City officers!"
// RandomFameString :
"P1352496692" "Did you see the front page? {HeroName} saved a bunch of policemen from the Circle of Thorns!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2073744128" "Well, the police stormed the Circle's base and managed to rescue their colleagues. According to the kidnapped officers, the Circle wanted to sacrifice them as part of some kind of protection spell. Ordinarily I'd be happy if they wanted to seal themselves off from us, but not if it means the lives of Paragon City officers!"
// RandomFameString :
"P3117976596" "I don't know what kind of town we're living in, where even the cops aren't safe!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_CoT_Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3332618222" "Some heroes have been kidnapped by the Circle of Thorns! I'm sure you've heard of the Paragon City Protectors. I've never had a chance to work with them, but most people agree they're some of the city's finest heroes. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to save the Protectors from the Circle of Thorns, {HeroName}.</A> You'll have maybe 90 minutes to save those members of the Protectors. I'm sure they'd do the same for you."
// AcceptString :
"P2372252643" "Save the Protectors from the Circle of Thorns"
// SendOffString :
"P1299692444" "When something like this happens to a hero, it really lowers the morale around here. I'm counting on you to bring it back up."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P534888021" "Save Protectors from Circle"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P70489993" "Please hurry, {HeroName}. The Protectors are in great peril!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3417092683" "You hear a blast of gunfire. It seems someone else is interested in liberating the Paragon City Protectors."

