"P1705779740" "The Protectors managed to escape, thanks in no small part to a rescue attempt by Crey Industries. I guess it's no surprise Crey would get involved; after all, the countess is the Protectors' sponsor. We're sure lucky they did, or the Protectors would have been goners!"
// RandomFameString :
"P1748126345" "{HeroName} tried to save the Paragon City Protectors, but I guess Crey Industries was the real hero this time!"

