// Dialog :
"P3235078849" "Diabolical. The Circle planned to sacrifice all those people in order to bring a section of their precious Oranbega to the surface world. If I were a ghost, I guess I might miss sunshine, too. Of course, I don't think I'd kill every last resident of Brickstown to get it."
// RandomFameString :
"P1218579093" "I'm thinking of writing a book about {HeroName}. Talk about a compelling character!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_CoT_Compund2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - OranbegansHere 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2594874624" "The arrival of the Oranbegans"
// DetailString :
"P2464648333" "One of the Circle of Thorns mystics you defeated told you:<br><br>'You may have shut down our portal, but our descendants are already here.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3484582885" "I just got word of a Circle plot that could alter the world as we know it. They're trying to set up a portal to an alternate dimension: a dimension in which their lost civilization of Oranbega flourished. If they can contact those Oranbegans, there's no telling what kind of damage they can do to this reality. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to stop the Circle of Thorns from contacting an alternate world!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P240085323" "Stop the Circle of Thorns from contacting an alternate world"
// SendOffString :
"P2425696516" "Please hurry! An alternate Oranbega could unleash a magical fury such as we have never seen!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_CoT_Compund2_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4254632209" "Destroy Circle's portal"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2312546118" "I can't stress the importance of this mission strongly enough. Please, destroy the Circle's portal before it's too late!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P690143961" "It's quiet in this base: no chanting, no voices, just the sound of your own rapid breath."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2515041193" "The Oranbegans we contacted should fit in nicely."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2181436243" "They are already learning much about their new home."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1881120019" "Fool! You may have shut down our portal, but our descendants are already here!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Portal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P913616454" "Portal"
// InteractBeginString :
"P3271577933" "You begin to destroy the portal."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2073946927" "You have destroyed the portal."
// InteractActionString :
"P3365161279" "Destroying..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3647037636" "You shut down the Circle's portal, but failed to prevent them from bringing in reinforcements from the alternate world's Oranbega. After calling your contact, you receive instructions to speak to Peter Stemitz about the possible threat these new Oranbegans could pose."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_CoT_Compund2_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3150173183" "Talk to Peter Stemitz"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4032609525" "Peter's been around for quite some time. He's our best chance at assessing the danger posed by these new Oranbegans."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4016693544" "You will suffer for your meddling, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1926990216" "Yo, {HeroName}. I guess you could say I know a little about the Oranbegans. In fact, I used to be one! I remember all of my past lives, and the one I lived in Oranbega was sweet. Grace, tranquility, intellectual achievement: that's what it was all about. It's still hard for me to believe that the Circle of Thorns grew from such a enlightened society. Whoops, there's my phone!<br><br>Whoa, {HeroName}! {ContactName} just called me with a major problem! There's a huge battle going on in a Circle of Thorns base! You should get over there before innocent bystanders are swept up in the chaos!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_CoT_Compund2_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P627277353" "Stop Circle's battle"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4069645132" "That Circle of Thorns base is still in chaos! If we let the situation continue, they could level that entire city block!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2329470273" "The sound of rapid mystical blasts ricochets off the walls."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4245899438" "These new Oranbegans are not what I expected."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3407359031" "Who could have known they would be so different?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3065609392" "This is not your concern!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP_ONE 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP_TWO 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - FIGHTER_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// FIGHTER_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P761937835" "You think you're better than us, huh?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - FIGHTER_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// FIGHTER_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1690673932" "I'll enjoy shedding your blood, heroes!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - FIGHTER_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// FIGHTER_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3126371538" "You are despicable creatures! We could never be like you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - FIGHTER_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// FIGHTER_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2529100624" "Now we can't get home!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ONE_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P182232932" "It seems we were wrong to call on you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1108134403" "Destroy these intruders!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4039700618" "Alternate world Oranbegan"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_TWO_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2713916789" "You should have left us in our own reality, you foul spirits!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P423030657" "You! You're the ones who destroyed the portal!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP_ONE 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP_TWO 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3724138952" "Lakash"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ONE_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4242814896" "Join with us or die!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4283563335" "You'll die for this intrusion!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME :
"P78539483" "Jonas of Oranbega"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_TWO_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P349929251" "We will not aid you in your evil plans!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4153542980" "You destroyed the portal to our world!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - FIGHTER_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// FIGHTER_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1168214267" "We brought you here to do our bidding."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - FIGHTER_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// FIGHTER_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4201664054" "Get ready to be burned to a crisp."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - FIGHTER_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// FIGHTER_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P404070826" "We will never be as cruel as you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - FIGHTER_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// FIGHTER_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2876316551" "Thanks to you, we're stuck here!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3395155810" "So, the Oranbegans from the alternate reality had no interest in joining the Circle of Thorns. On the contrary, they seemed to be as appalled by the Circle's practices as we are. It's strange to think that they were once the same people. I wonder what happened to the Circle, to turn them into such ghouls?"
// RandomFameString :
"P548323943" "The Circle of Thorns can't compete with {HeroName}, that's for sure!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_CoT_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2933787269" "There have been a lot of kidnappings taking place in Founders' Falls. Just last week, a whole book club disappeared. Most people don't even feel safe enough to walk down the streets alone. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get over to Founders' Falls and defeat as many mystics as you can.</A> Let's make it clear that we won't tolerate the Circle preying on our civilian population."
// AcceptString :
"P1406817160" "Go to Founders' Falls and defeat as many mystics as you can"
// SendOffString :
"P1395440818" "Take care of yourself, {HeroName}."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1213574279" "Defeat Circle in Founders' Falls"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2454548189" "You haven't done enough to discourage the Circle's activities in Founders' Falls."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2187324918" "You discouraged the Circle's activities in Founders' Falls."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2846024246" "Thanks, {HeroName}. I think the people living in Founders' Falls can breathe a little more easily now."
// RandomFameString :
"P3557696398" "Did you see {HeroName} over in Founders' Falls? The Circle had to turn tail and run!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_CoT_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2601152478" "The Circle of Thorns is collecting a lot of new devotees from Founders' Falls. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get out to Founders' Falls and defeat a few mystics.</A> That way, people will see that the Circle's power isn't the answer to their hopes and fears."
// AcceptString :
"P2853612432" "Go to Founders' Falls and defeat a few mystics"
// SendOffString :
"P4262029474" "People need to understand that the Circle's power always crumbles in the face of a real hero."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4080957927" "I need you to defeat a few more Circle mystics. That way, people will understand who wields the real power in this town."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3350061776" "You have discouraged the civilians in Founders' Falls from following the Circle of Thorns."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3350804177" "In times like these, it's easy for people to think that a little extra power is worth compromising their ethics. I bet your activities helped a lot of people steer clear of the wrong path."
// RandomFameString :
"P1298384191" "I was thinking of joining the Circle of Thorns, but I changed my mind after seeing {HeroName} in action."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_CoT_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P225224775" "Fighting against The Circle of Thorns is as important as it is difficult, {HeroName}. With what we now know about the Circle's true origins, it may even be an endless battle. That doesn't mean that it isn't one that has to be fought. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to be on the lookout for Circle of Thorns activity and stop it wherever you find it.</A> We can't let those mystics gain in strength for a single day."
// AcceptString :
"P441250056" "Fight Circle of Thorns activity wherever it's found."
// SendOffString :
"P1118674605" "The heroes of the city have to maintain a constant vigilance against Circle of Thorns activity, {HeroName}, or else we're doomed."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P451985252" "Combat Circle menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2274555647" "The Circle will grow stronger by the day if you aren't able to fight them, {HeroName}"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1626766630" "You have defeated enough Circle of Thorns mystics for the moment."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P550103474" "Some days I wonder if the city will ever be safe from the Circle of Thorns, {HeroName}. Then I realize that as long as there are heroes like you who are ready to battle the Circle's plots, we are safe."
// RandomFameString :
"P684103513" "All the magic in the world can't save the Circle from {HeroName}!"

